# At the beginning of Bloodthief's controller's end step, if an opponent lost life this turn, a +1/+1 counter goes on a target Vampire
# that player controls. Bot1 attacks unblocked with Bloodthief on turn 3 (Bot2 20 -> 18) with a second Vampire, a non-Vampire (Memnite)
# and Bot2's Vampire Noble on the table: the counter may go on Queen's Bay Soldier (the refusals show the non-Vampire and the
# opponent's Vampire are not candidates) and not on Bloodthief itself (CR 603.4, intervening "if").

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Stromkirk Bloodthief
Queen's Bay Soldier
Memnite
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
